WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:05.662
Listen to the end of the verbs. Is it t, d, or id?

2
00:00:07.112 --> 00:00:12.267
Last night, Maria went to a party. She danced all night.

3
00:00:12.717 --> 00:00:15.085
She danced. Danced.

4
00:00:17.335 --> 00:00:21.004
On Saturday, the kids played soccer in the park.

5
00:00:21.454 --> 00:00:23.590
They played. Played.

6
00:00:25.840 --> 00:00:30.531
On Sunday, Tom visited his grandmother. They had lunch in the garden.

7
00:00:30.981 --> 00:00:32.838
He visited. Visited.

8
00:00:35.088 --> 00:00:38.850
Yesterday, I cooked dinner for my family. I cooked pasta!

9
00:00:41.100 --> 00:00:45.790
Last summer, we traveled to the beach. We traveled by car.

10
00:00:48.040 --> 00:00:54.310
And you? Tell me about your day yesterday. Say the verbs with the right sound!

